@WebApiCore_HostAddress = http://localhost:5039
@AdminUsername = admin
@AdminPassword = {{$dotenv ADMIN_PASSWORD}}

### Health check
GET {{WebApiCore_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Published landing-page content and catalog
GET {{WebApiCore_HostAddress}}/api/content
Accept: application/json

### Admin content requires authentication
GET {{WebApiCore_HostAddress}}/api/admin/content
Accept: application/json

### Sign in (configure ADMIN_PASSWORD in the REST Client environment)
POST {{WebApiCore_HostAddress}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{AdminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{AdminPassword}}"
}

### Update landing-page content and catalog
PUT {{WebApiCore_HostAddress}}/api/admin/content
Content-Type: application/json

